    <region left="18" top="2034" width="436" height="83" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">4. Nonlinear 5x5 system - optim_lbfgs on the sum of squared residuals</p>
    <p bold="true">Broyden diverges on this system, so SSE = r1^2 + r2^2 + r3^2 + r4^2 + r5^2 is</p>
    <p bold="true">minimised directly. Expected root [1, 2, -1, 1, 2]; SSE ~ 0; ok = 1.</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
