    <region left="18" top="3528" width="364" height="83" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="DejaVu Sans" fontSize="10">
        <content>
    <p bold="true">5. Residual measure at the found point (|f|) for the two solvers</p>
    <p bold="true">Both should be ~ 0: Broyden reports max|ri| for the linear system,</p>
    <p bold="true">L-BFGS reports the sum of squares for the nonlinear system.</p>
    </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="18" top="3627" width="330" height="240" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <xyplot animFrameRate="20" animPlaybackMode="RepeatIndefinitely" width="320" height="232" points="100" name="XYPlot" keepAspectRatio="false">
